on-approved spare parts or components are used without the prior written approval of NNIT. Any breach of the terms and conditions of this Contract shall likewise result in the immediate termination of the warranty obligations of NNIT.</p>',18,0,'2026-10-23 09:44:10.768064','2026-10-23 09:44:10.768089',16,18);
